				<r3d:description language="eng">ModelDB is a curated database of published models in the broad domain of computational neuroscience. It addresses the need for access to such models in order to evaluate their validity and extend their use. It can handle computational models expressed in any textual form, including procedural or declarative languages (e.g. C++, XML dialects) and source code written for any simulation environment. The model source code doesn&#039;t even have to reside inside ModelDB; it just has to be available from some publicly accessible online repository or WWW site.</r3d:description>
